message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: UniChecksum
abstract: >-
  CRC-32 (IEEE 802.3), CRC-64/XZ (ECMA-182) and Adler-32 (RFC 1950) in Nim,
  with a C ABI and a Python binding: the error-detecting codes container
  formats mandate, checked against the published check values.
type: software
